<theodulf. carm. 24.1>	Inclita Fastradae reginae hic membra quiescunt,
<theodulf. carm. 24.2>	De medio quam mors frigida flore tulit:
<theodulf. carm. 24.3>	Nobilis ipsa viri thalamo coniuncta potentis,
<theodulf. carm. 24.4>	Sed modo caelesti nobilior thalamo.
<theodulf. carm. 24.5>	Pars animae melior Carolus rex ipse remansit:
<theodulf. carm. 24.6>	Cui tradat mitis tempora larga deus.
